@startuml
skinparam dpi 300
scale max 2000 width
title 05. [Admin] Configure Internal Services for Wallet

|Service Owner|
start
:Define Service Requirement;
note right
  Determines if it's a Library Fine,
  Parking Pass, or Canteen Package.
end note

|System Admin|
:Submit Configuration Request;

if (Configuration Type?) then (New Service)
  :Register Service Profile;
  note right
    **Parameters include:**
    * Unique Service Code
    * Internal Category
    * Default Pricing Rules
  end note

  |Wallet System|
  if (Code Unique & Category Valid?) then (No)
    :Reject Registration;
    note right: Error: Duplicate Code \nor Invalid Type
    stop
  else (Yes)
    :Activate for Wallet Payment;
  endif

else (Edit Existing)
  |System Admin|
  :Modify Service Parameters;
  note right: Updates Name, Price Policy, \nor Operational Status.

  |Wallet System|
  :Commit Update to Ledger Rules;
endif

|Wallet System|
:Synchronize with POS & Portals;
note right
  Makes the service live for
  Library, Parking, and Canteen staff.
end note

|Service Owner|
:Verify Operational Readiness;
stop
@enduml